 'consequence':'The previously cubic T^m -> T^d mechanism is an all-orders global phase-locking theorem. Dimension d is inherited from the carrier translation group, not selected by the nonlinearity.',
 'nonconclusions':['The theorem does not source d, the product carrier, radial amplitudes, dynamics, or physical space.']
}
p=ROOT/'results'/'RESONANCE-CERT-03_product_all_orders.json';p.write_text(json.dumps(out,indent=2,sort_keys=True)+'\n')
